WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
EN: English is fast becoming the world's universal language.
ZH: 英语正在快速成为世界通用语言。

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
EN: And instant translation technology is improving every year.
ZH: 即时翻译技术也在每一年进步。

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
EN: So why should we bother to learn another language?
ZH: 那我们为什么还要费心学习另一门语言？

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
EN: There are many reasons, but I want to focus on four.
ZH: 理由有很多，但我想重点谈四个。

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
EN: The first is that languages channel your thoughts.
ZH: 第一点是，语言会引导你的思维方式。

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
EN: Different languages give you different ways to see the world.
ZH: 不同语言会给你不同的看世界方式。

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.000
EN: The second reason is that language is a gateway into culture.
ZH: 第二个理由是，语言是进入文化的一道入口。

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
EN: You do not just learn words; you learn how people live.
ZH: 你学到的不只是词汇，也是在理解人们如何生活。

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:57.000
EN: The third reason is that learning a language is good for your brain.
ZH: 第三个理由是，学习语言对大脑有益。

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
EN: It can make you more flexible, more patient, and more curious.
ZH: 它能让你更灵活、更有耐心，也更有好奇心。

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.000
EN: Finally, learning a language lets you connect with people directly.
ZH: 最后，学习语言能让你直接与他人建立连接。

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.000
EN: Translation is useful, but speaking to someone yourself feels different.
ZH: 翻译很有用，但亲自与人交谈的感觉是不一样的。
